=== Irrational Rotation (Circle Map) ===
x_{n+1} = {x_n + α} mod 1 with α = √2 mod 1:
First 10 positions: 0.414214 0.828427 0.242641 0.656854 0.071068 0.485281 0.899495 0.313708 0.727922 0.142136

=== Three-Gap Theorem ===
For N points {kα mod 1 : k=0..N}, the N+1 gaps
between consecutive sorted points take at most 3 values.

=== PE Answer ===
885226002
